  "name": "cargo-public-api",
  "description": "A comprehensive toolchain for listing and diffing the public API of Rust library crates by leveraging rustdoc JSON artifacts. It facilitates automated semver violation detection and public API surface tracking through a CLI subcommand and a set of reusable library crates. The system includes specialized components for managing rustup toolchains, building rustdoc JSON, and rendering semantic diffs between commits or published versions.",
